Package: oddsapiio
Title: Client for the 'Odds-API.io' Sports Betting Odds API
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person("Markus", "Bjermeland", email = "markus@odds-api.io", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Query live and upcoming sports betting odds from the
    'Odds-API.io' REST API <https://docs.odds-api.io>. Covers sports,
    markets, bookmakers, leagues, participants, events, per-event and
    multi-event odds, odds deltas, odds movements, odds summaries, value
    bets, arbitrage bets, dropping odds, historical events, odds and
    closing lines, bet settlement and grading, outright (futures) odds and
    results, and bookmaker id mappings across 450+ bookmakers, returned as
    tidy data frames. An API key from a paid plan is required.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://odds-api.io, https://docs.odds-api.io, https://github.com/odds-api-io/odds-api-r
BugReports: https://github.com/odds-api-io/odds-api-r/issues
Depends:
    R (>= 4.0.0)
Encoding: UTF-8
Roxygen: list(markdown = TRUE)
Imports:
    httr2 (>= 1.1.0),
    jsonlite,
    stats,
    utils
Suggests:
    testthat (>= 3.0.0)
Config/testthat/edition: 3
Config/roxygen2/version: 8.0.0
